{"id": "63212", "title": "芙蓉成长记", "author": "最爱零食", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 46, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/63/63212.htm", "intro": "感觉自己被安置于一个奇妙的空间，无边的黑暗，却莫名的心安。许是正处于一种假睡眠状态，周身毛细血管空前扩张，通体舒畅，一切都是那么祥和，安宁，舒适。懒洋洋的，却无法发出任何音节， 大惊之下浑沌初开，意识复苏了。此刻我全身以一种极度弯曲的姿态，微缩在一个温暖湿润的未知领域，动弹不得，甚至连睁眼也不能。先前的舒适感立马被恐惧不安替代，尽管无力动弹，感官却变得异常敏锐。", "base": "files/article/html/63/63212", "chapters": [{"title": "横空出世", "file": "9357621.html", "available": false}, {"title": "幼龙戏凤", "file": "9357623.html", "available": false}, {"title": "虚惊一场", "file": "9357624.html", "available": false}, {"title": "芙蓉发鬟", "file": "9357625.html", "available": false}, {"title": "皇宫夜宴", "file": "9357626.html", "available": false}, {"title": "娃娃学艺", "file": "9357628.html", "available": false}, {"title": "丐帮鼻祖", "file": "9357630.html", "available": false}, {"title": "私定终生", "file": "9357632.html", "available": false}, {"title": "屡屡受挫", "file": "9357636.html", "available": false}, {"title": "幼鸟归巢", "file": "9357638.html", "available": false}, {"title": "小盗落网", "file": "9357639.html", "available": false}, {"title": "乞丐千金", "file": "9357640.html", "available": false}, {"title": "义父离世", "file": "9357647.html", "available": false}, {"title": "婚姻通病", "file": "9357649.html", "available": false}, {"title": "冤家路窄", "file": "9357651.html", "available": false}, {"title": "洞房花烛", "file": "9357652.html", "available": false}, {"title": "霸王得姬", "file": "9357654.html", "available": false}, {"title": "飞来血灾", "file": "9357656.html", "available": false}, {"title": "山中庵堂", "file": "9357658.html", "available": false}, {"title": "非常计谋", "file": "9357660.html", "available": false}, {"title": "挑战冰块", "file": "9357662.html", "available": false}, {"title": "煽风点火", "file": "9357664.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情犊初开", "file": "9357666.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 24 章", "file": "9357667.html", "available": false}, {"title": "迷雾渐显", "file": "9357669.html", "available": false}, 